WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.900
Your best ideas turn up on walks.

00:03.300 --> 00:05.800
Just talk. Mosey listens.

00:06.200 --> 00:08.400
Your phone stays in your pocket.

00:08.800 --> 00:12.800
Read it back as a calm, clear note.

00:13.200 --> 00:16.600
Mosey spots the ideas you had.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.200
Keep every one of them.

00:20.600 --> 00:24.100
See what keeps coming up.

00:24.100 --> 00:27.500
Mosey. Talk it through on your walk.
